##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
[`
              \begin{aligned}[t]
              \frac{1}{3}\div\frac{10}{7}\amp=\frac{1}{3}\cdot\frac{7}{10}\\
              \amp=\frac{7}{30}\\
              \ 
              \end{aligned}
              `]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

