##########
# Solution
##########

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
[`
              \begin{aligned}[t]
              -14\div\frac{3}{2}\amp=-14\cdot\frac{2}{3}\\
              \amp=-\frac{14}{1}\cdot\frac{2}{3}\\
              \amp=-\frac{28}{3}
              \end{aligned}
              `]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

Section::End();

